TEST 38152 -- RSTP - Basic operation
===========================================================================
Run: 2026-09-22 11:58:32  tb470
Topology: a REAL ring -- DUT port1.0.2 -- x230 -- 4050 -- DUT port4.0.2 (po1).
The x230<->4050 leg is normally held shut on this bench because RSTP is
disabled by default here; this case enables RSTP on all three devices first,
which is what makes closing the ring safe.

